[Term]
id: DOID:0050148
name: laryngotracheitis
def: "An upper respiratory tract disease involving inflammation of both larynx and trachea often caused by viral infection. The infection can close off the windpipe. (DO)" [https://www.merriam-webster.com/medical/laryngotracheitis "DO"]
