[Term]
id: DOID:0050150
name: Pontiac fever
def: "A legionellosis that involves a milder respiratory illness without pneumonia. Symptoms include fever, headache and muscle aches which last for 2 to 5 days. (DO)" [http://www.cdc.gov/legionella/patient_facts.htm "DO", PMID:623097 "DO"]
