[Term]
id: DOID:0050177
name: monogenic disease
def: "A genetic disease that is the result of one or more abnormal alleles and may be dominant, semi-dominant, or recessive. (DO)" [https://www.genome.gov/For-Patients-and-Families/Genetic-Disorders "DO"]
