id: DOID:0050202
name: Lujo hemorrhagic fever
def: "A viral infectious disease that results_in infection, has_material_basis_in Lujo virus (Mammarenavirus lujoense), which has_symptom fever, has_symptom headache, has_symptom myalgia, has_symptom thrombocytopenia, and has_symptom bleeding. Bleeding is minor and not a prominent symptom. (DO)" [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lujo_virus "DO", https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC2866397/ "DO", https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4230886/ "DO", https://www.cdc.gov/lujo-fever/about/index.html "DO", PMID:19478873 "DO"]
