id: DOID:0050256
name: angiostrongyliasis
def: "A parasitic helminthiasis infectious disease that involves parasitic infection of the intestine, central nervous system and eyes by Angiostrongylus cantonensis or Angiostrongylus costaricensis. (DO)" [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angiostrongyliasis "DO"]
synonym: "abdominal angiostrongyliasis" EXACT []
