[Term]
id: DOID:0050269
name: Trichomonas vaginalis trichomoniasis
def: "A trichomoniasis that involves infection of the urogenital tract, has_material_basis_in Trichomonas vaginalis, which is transmitted through sexual contact. Symptoms include inflammation of the cervix, urethra and vagina which produce an itching or burning sensation, and yellow-green, itchy, frothy foul-smelling vaginal discharge. (DO)" [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trichomoniasis "DO"]
