def: "A cerebral palsy that is caused by damage to the cerebellum, which affects muscle coordination, particularly in the limb. Some individuals suffer from hypotonia, tremors, difficulty with visual and/or auditory processing. (DO)" [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cerebral_palsy#Ataxic "DO", http://www.brainandspinalcord.org/cerebral-palsy/types/ataxic-cerebral-palsy.html "DO"]
