creation_date: 2017-10-24T00:00:00Z

[Term]
id: DOID:0050673
name: mixed cerebral palsy
def: "A cerebral palsy that is caused by injury to both the pyramidal and extra pyramidal areas of the brain, which results in both the tight muscle tone and the involuntary movements. The individual have difficulty with speaking and swallowing. (DO)" [http://www.brainandspinalcord.org/cerebral-palsy/types/mixed-cerebral-palsy "DO", http://www.cerebralpalsysource.com/Types_of_CP/mixed_cp/index.html "DO"]
