[Term]
id: DOID:0080315
name: megalencephalic leukoencephalopathy with subcortical cysts
def: "A leukodystorphy characterized by infantile-onset macrocephaly, often with mild neurologic signs at presentation (such as mild motor delay), which worse with time, leading to poor ambulation, falls, ataxia, spasticity, increasing seizures and cognitive decline. (DO)" [https://ghr.nlm.nih.gov/condition/megalencephalic-leukoencephalopathy-with-subcortical-cysts "DO"]
