def: "A lymphomatoid granulomatosis that is characterized by the presence of aggregates of neoplastic large B-lymphocytes, usually admixed with pleomorphic and Hodgkin-like cells, in a background of chronic inflammation. Necrotic changes are present and are usually extensive. (DO)" [https://rarediseases.org/rare-diseases/lymphomatoid-granulomatosis/?filter=ovr-ds-resources "DO"]
