def: "A metal metabolism disorder characterized by hyperelastic and bruisable skin, hernias, bladder diverticula, hyperextensible joints, varicosities, abnormal copper transport, and multiple skeletal abnormalities that has_material_basis_in X-linked recessive inheritance of mutations in ATP7A on Xq21.1. This disorder is allelic to Menkes disease. (DO)" [PMID:7842019 "DO", PMID:7887410 "DO"]
