name: NEURODEVELOPMENTAL DISORDER WITH MICROCEPHALY, SEIZURES, AND BRAIN ATROPHY
def: "An autosomal recessive disorder characterized by severe global developmental delay, developmental regression with loss of milestones, severe microcephaly, and brain abnormalities, primarily cerebral atrophy and hypoplasia of the corpus callosum. Affected individuals develop seizures in the first year of life; eventually they are unable to sit, feed, or communicate, and may be unresponsive to stimuli." [MIM:619076]
