[Term]
id: DOID:9009321
name: NEURODEVELOPMENTAL DISORDER WITH POOR GROWTH, ABSENT SPEECH, PROGRESSIVE ATAXIA, AND DYSMORPHIC FACIES
def: "This disease is a severe autosomal recessive disorder with onset of symptoms in infancy. Affected individuals have poor overall growth (microcephaly, short stature), dysmorphic facies, delayed motor development with ataxic or spastic gait, and impaired intellectual development with absent speech." [MIM:621067]
synonym: "NEDGSAF" EXACT []
