[Term]
id: DOID:9009334
name: neurodegenerative disorder, X-linked, female-restricted, with parkinsonism and cognitive impairment
def: "This disease is characterized by the onset of progressive movement abnormalities consistent with parkinsonism. The typical age at onset is mid-to-late adulthood, although some affected individuals show learning difficulties earlier in life. Brain imaging may show cerebral or cerebellar atrophy. The disorder is restricted to females, but females with heterozygous SLC9A6 mutations have a highly variable phenotype, ranging from unaffected to adult-onset severe neurodegeneration." [MIM:301142]
synonym: "NDPACX" EXACT []
synonym: "X-linked female-restricted neurodegenerative disorder with parkinsonism and cognitive impairment" EXACT []
